{"seq":1,"slug":"why-partition","title":"为何分区：单机瓶颈与扩展维度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/foundations/why-partition","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何分区-单机瓶颈与扩展维度\">为何分区：单机瓶颈与扩展维度</h1><p>一台配置顶级的数据库服务器——比如 128 核、2TB 内存、几块 NVMe SSD——看起来似乎能扛住任何负载，直到某个周一早上你发现 P99 延迟从 20 毫秒飙到了 800 毫秒，而 CPU 利用率才 40%。瓶颈往往不在你盯着的那个指标上。理解单机会在何处、以何种方式触顶，是判断「该不该分片」的前提，也是避免把一个本可以靠加内存解决的问题误诊成「必须分库分表」的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单机数据库的容量不是一个单一数字，而是由若干相互牵制的资源维度共同决定的。当任意一个维度先于其他维度耗尽，整台机器的有效吞吐就被它锁死，这就是「木桶效应」在数据库上的体现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[请求负载增长] --&gt; B{哪个资源先触顶?}&#10;    B --&gt;|连接数| C[连接耗尽&lt;br/&gt;新请求排队]&#10;    B --&gt;|缓冲池| D[命中率下降&lt;br/&gt;磁盘随机读暴增]&#10;    B --&gt;|写入| E[写放大与刷盘&lt;br/&gt;WAL 与 fsync 瓶颈]&#10;    B --&gt;|存储| F[单表过大&lt;br/&gt;备份窗口超时]&#10;    C --&gt; G[延迟升高/超时]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{加机器还是拆数据?}&#10;    H --&gt;|纵向| I[Scale Up 加配置]&#10;    H --&gt;|横向| J[Scale Out 分片]\">flowchart TD\n    A[请求负载增长] --&gt; B{哪个资源先触顶?}\n    B --&gt;|连接数| C[连接耗尽&lt;br/&gt;新请求排队]\n    B --&gt;|缓冲池| D[命中率下降&lt;br/&gt;磁盘随机读暴增]\n    B --&gt;|写入| E[写放大与刷盘&lt;br/&gt;WAL 与 fsync 瓶颈]\n    B --&gt;|存储| F[单表过大&lt;br/&gt;备份窗口超时]\n    C --&gt; G[延迟升高/超时]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{加机器还是拆数据?}\n    H --&gt;|纵向| I[Scale Up 加配置]\n    H --&gt;|横向| J[Scale Out 分片]</pre><p>扩展有两条根本不同的路径。下表对比二者的核心特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>垂直扩展 Scale Up</th>\n<th>水平扩展 Scale Out</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>做法</td>\n<td>换更强的单机（更多核/内存/更快盘）</td>\n<td>增加机器数量，把数据分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上限</td>\n<td>受单机硬件物理上限约束</td>\n<td>理论上近乎线性可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本曲线</td>\n<td>高端硬件价格非线性飙升</td>\n<td>商用机器线性叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>几乎无需改应用</td>\n<td>引入分布式复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障域</td>\n<td>单点，一损俱损</td>\n<td>单分片故障只影响局部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用阶段</td>\n<td>中小规模、快速见效</td>\n<td>大规模、长期演进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"连接数与并发的隐形天花板\">连接数与并发的隐形天花板</h2><p>很多人第一次撞到的墙不是 CPU 也不是磁盘，而是连接数。每个数据库连接在 PostgreSQL 里对应一个操作系统进程，在 MySQL 里对应一个线程，都要占用内存（PostgreSQL 单连接常见 5–10MB）并参与锁与缓存的竞争。当上层有几百个应用实例、每个又维护一个连接池时，几千个连接就足以让数据库的内存被连接元数据吃掉一大块，上下文切换开销陡增。</p>\n<p>连接池中间件（如 PgBouncer）能把上万个客户端连接复用到几百个真实后端连接上，缓解这一维度——但它治标不治本：当真实需要并发执行的查询数本身就超过了机器的 CPU 能力时，再怎么复用连接也无济于事。此时排队不可避免，延迟随负载非线性恶化。这是「先于其他资源触顶」的典型例子：你可能 CPU、内存都还有余量，却已经被连接模型卡死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲池与工作集的错配\">缓冲池与工作集的错配</h2><p>数据库的读性能在很大程度上取决于工作集（被频繁访问的那部分数据）能否驻留在内存缓冲池里。当数据量增长到工作集超过缓冲池容量时，命中率会从 99% 跌到 90%，看似只差 9 个百分点，实际意味着缓存未命中的请求数翻了十倍——而每一次未命中都是一次磁盘随机读，即便在 NVMe SSD 上也比内存访问慢两三个数量级。</p>\n<p>设缓冲池命中率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，内存访问延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，磁盘访问延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则平均访问延迟近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = h \\cdot t_m + (1 - h) \\cdot t_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d \\gg t_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 略微下降时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-h) \\cdot t_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一项会迅速主导整个延迟。这解释了为什么数据量「悄悄」越过某个临界点后，性能会断崖式下跌而非平滑退化。分片的价值在于：把数据分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 台机器后，每台只需缓存全量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，工作集重新落回各自的缓冲池内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写入瓶颈与备份窗口\">写入瓶颈与备份窗口</h2><p>读可以靠只读副本横向扩展，但写不行——所有写最终都要落到主库的同一份 WAL（预写日志）并经历 fsync 刷盘。单调递增的主键、二级索引的维护、以及为持久性而做的同步刷盘，共同构成了写入侧的天花板。当每秒写入量逼近主库单线程刷盘能力时，副本再多也救不了写吞吐，唯一的出路是把写分散到多个主分片上——这正是分片解决而读副本解决不了的问题。分区键的选择直接决定写能否被均匀分散，详见 <a href=\"partition-keys\">分区键的选择</a>。</p>\n<p>另一个常被低估的运维维度是备份与维护窗口。一张几 TB 的表，逻辑备份可能耗时数小时，索引重建会长时间持锁，schema 变更（加列、改类型）在大表上动辄锁表或拖垮复制延迟。把大表水平拆小，每个分片的备份、重建、变更都成了可并行、可滚动执行的小操作，运维的可控性质变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时不该分片\">何时不该分片</h2><p>分片引入的复杂度是实打实的：跨分片查询变难（见 <a href=\"../challenges/cross-shard-queries\">跨分片查询与聚合</a>）、事务边界收缩、运维面变宽、再平衡棘手（见 <a href=\"../challenges/rebalancing-resharding\">再平衡与重分片</a>）。因此在分片之前，应当先穷尽更便宜的手段：加索引消除全表扫描、用读副本卸载读流量、引入缓存层挡住热点读、用连接池缓解连接压力、用表分区（单机内拆表）缩小单次扫描范围。这些手段往往能把分片的时点推迟一两年，而那段时间里你对数据访问模式的理解会成熟得多，分区键也就选得更准。</p>\n<p>「过早分片」和「过晚分片」都是错误，但代价不对称：过晚分片是在着火时搬家，过早分片则是给一栋平房装电梯。判断的依据应当是真实触顶的资源维度，而不是数据行数这个孤立数字。关于分区与分片这两个概念的本质区别，见 <a href=\"partitioning-vs-sharding\">分区与分片：概念辨析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单机瓶颈是多维的：连接数、缓冲池命中率、写入刷盘、备份窗口，任一维度先触顶就锁死整机吞吐。</li>\n<li>缓冲池命中率的小幅下降会因磁盘与内存的数量级差异引发延迟的断崖式恶化。</li>\n<li>写入是读副本救不了的硬约束，只有把写分散到多个主分片才能扩展写吞吐。</li>\n<li>垂直扩展见效快但有物理上限，水平扩展近乎线性但引入分布式复杂度。</li>\n<li>分片之前应先穷尽索引、读副本、缓存、连接池、单机分区等更便宜的手段。</li>\n<li>判断时点要看真实触顶的资源维度，而非孤立的行数；过早与过晚分片代价不对称。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何分区：单机瓶颈与扩展维度","id":"为何分区-单机瓶颈与扩展维度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"连接数与并发的隐形天花板","id":"连接数与并发的隐形天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲池与工作集的错配","id":"缓冲池与工作集的错配"},{"level":2,"text":"写入瓶颈与备份窗口","id":"写入瓶颈与备份窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"何时不该分片","id":"何时不该分片"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"分区与分片：概念辨析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/foundations/partitioning-vs-sharding"}}